---
// AIDLC Suite — product cards adapted to site beige theme
---

<div class="aidlc-grid">

  <!-- VS Code Extension -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-head">
      <div class="ac-icon ac-icon--blue">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 7 9 12l5 5"/><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="18" rx="3"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>AIDLC for VS Code</h3>
        <span class="ac-kind">VS Code Extension</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="ac-desc">The Builder UI for your AI pipelines. Edit <code>workspace.yaml</code> visually, follow active runs in the sidebar, and open the AIDLC Monitor for token usage and live agent observability.</p>
    <ul class="ac-features">
      <li>Visual Builder for <code>.aidlc/workspace.yaml</code></li>
      <li>Sidebar with live run states &amp; commands</li>
      <li>AIDLC Monitor — tokens, sessions, agents</li>
      <li>Session-insights dashboard from Claude transcripts</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="ac-actions">
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-primary" href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=hueanmy.aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
        Install from VS Code Marketplace
      </a>
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-ghost" href="https://open-vsx.org/extension/hueanmy/aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Install from Open VSX</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CLI -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-head">
      <div class="ac-icon ac-icon--green">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>AIDLC CLI</h3>
        <span class="ac-kind">Terminal · npm</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="ac-desc">The standalone engine — no VS Code required. Scaffold workspaces, apply pipeline presets, drive runs end-to-end via Claude, and watch everything live from your shell.</p>
    <ul class="ac-features">
      <li><code>aidlc init</code> + presets: sdlc, code-review, release-notes</li>
      <li><code>aidlc run exec --auto-approve</code> — unattended runs</li>
      <li><code>aidlc watch</code> / <code>tail</code> — live run table &amp; stream</li>
      <li><code>aidlc dashboard</code> — browser UI on localhost</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="ac-actions">
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-primary" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc/tree/main/packages/cli" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"/></svg>
        npm install -g aidlc
      </a>
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source on GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AIDLC Term -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-head">
      <div class="ac-icon ac-icon-img">
        <img src="https://aidlc-io.github.io/assets/aidlc-term.png" alt="AIDLC Term" width="40" height="40" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>AIDLC Term</h3>
        <span class="ac-kind">macOS · Windows (beta) · Rust + wgpu</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="ac-desc">A GPU-accelerated terminal built for agent work: file explorer that follows your shell, agent manager for every Claude Code session, and a live token-usage dashboard.</p>
    <ul class="ac-features">
      <li>GPU rendering (wgpu) — tabs, splits, IME-perfect input</li>
      <li>Agent Manager — status, live tails, focus / interrupt</li>
      <li>Usage Dashboard — burn rate &amp; limit prediction</li>
      <li>File tree follows the shell's cwd</li>
      <li>Native shortcuts — ⌘ on macOS, Ctrl+Shift on Windows</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="ac-actions">
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-primary" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-io.github.io/releases/download/term-v0.3.2/AIDLC-Term-0.3.2.dmg">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.81-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M13 3.5c.73-.83 1.94-1.46 2.94-1.5.13 1.17-.34 2.35-1.04 3.19-.69.85-1.83 1.51-2.95 1.42-.15-1.15.41-2.35 1.05-3.11z"/></svg>
        Download for macOS <span class="ac-sub">v0.3.2 · 5.5 MB</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-io.github.io/releases/download/term-v0.3.2/AIDLC-Term-0.3.2-windows.zip">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M3 5.5 10 4.5v7H3zM11 4.3 21 3v8.5H11zM3 12.5h7v7l-7-1zM11 12.5h10V21l-10-1.3z"/></svg>
        Download for Windows <span class="ac-sub">v0.3.2 · 5.3 MB</span>
      </a>
      <p class="ac-note">macOS: not notarized — first launch via System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Open Anyway. Windows is in beta.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AIDLC TestAgent -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-head">
      <div class="ac-icon ac-icon--orange">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>AIDLC TestAgent</h3>
        <span class="ac-kind">Open Source · TypeScript</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="ac-desc">Open-source AI test agent for web, desktop, API &amp; mobile. Point it at a target, approve the plan, get a passing test suite. No telemetry, no model API keys required.</p>
    <ul class="ac-features">
      <li>Supports web, desktop, API &amp; mobile targets</li>
      <li>Approve the generated test plan before execution</li>
      <li>No telemetry, no external model API keys</li>
      <li>Outputs a runnable test suite you own</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="ac-actions">
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-primary" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-testagent" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27s1.36.09 2 .27c1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
        View on GitHub
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .aidlc-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .aidlc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .aidlc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .ac-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: box-shadow 150ms ease, transform 150ms ease;
  }
  .ac-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* Icon */
  .ac-icon {
    width: 40px; height: 40px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .ac-icon--blue   { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1);  color: #3b82f6; }
  .ac-icon--green  { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.12);  color: #16a34a; }
  .ac-icon--orange { background: var(--accent-soft);     color: var(--accent); }
  .ac-icon-img {
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
  }
  .ac-icon-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 9px; display: block; }

  .ac-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .ac-head h3 {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 0 0 0.1rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .ac-kind {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ac-desc {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .ac-desc code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82em;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.05em 0.3em;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
  }

  .ac-features {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .ac-features li {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    padding: 0.22rem 0 0.22rem 1.1rem;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ac-features li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0.1rem;
    top: 0.6rem;
    width: 5px; height: 5px;
    border-radius: 1.5px;
    background: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .ac-features code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.05em 0.3em;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
  }

  .ac-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }
  .ac-btn {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 120ms, border-color 120ms, box-shadow 120ms;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ac-btn-primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .ac-btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); }

  .ac-btn-ghost {
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .ac-btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--fg-muted); color: var(--fg); }

  .ac-sub {
    font-weight: 400;
    opacity: 0.75;
    font-size: 0.66rem;
  }
  .ac-note {
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
